[00:00.44]You're glowing
[00:00.44]你熠熠生辉
[00:03.50]You colour and fracture the light
[00:03.50]你的光影 那破碎的光线
[00:06.51]You can't help but shine
[00:06.51]无法抑制地闪耀
[00:10.51]And I know that
[00:10.51]我知道
[00:13.54]You carry the world on your back
[00:13.54]你肩负重担
