[00:22.27]你的面庞
[00:23.55]Your eyes
[00:23.55]你的眼眸
[00:24.89]Exploding like fireworks in the sky
[00:24.89]像烟花般 在夜空绽放
[00:30.76]
[00:30.78]Sapphire
[00:30.78]蓝宝石
[00:31.48]Touching on your body while you're pushing on me
[00:31.48]轻触你的身躯 你贴近着我
[00:33.98]Don't you end the party
[00:33.98]别让派对结束
[00:35.00]I could do this all week
[00:35.00]我可以这样度过整周
[00:36.21]We'll be dancing till the morning
